      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Goods worth around €8.2 billion are stolen&nbsp;in Europe every year. To increase the security of these goods, transporters are increasingly equipping themselves with connected telematics solutions.</span></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">To meet this challenge and offer a complete solution, we advise you to integrate&nbsp;truck door opening&nbsp;detection into your IoT solution. Using ELA Innovations wireless magnetic sensors, you can simply detect when a truck door is open and&nbsp;alert the driver in real time&nbsp;through your business application.</span></p>",
      "bodyText": "Goods worth around €8.2 billion are stolen in Europe every year. To increase the security of these goods, transporters are increasingly equipping themselves with connected telematics solutions.To meet this challenge and offer a complete solution, we advise you to integrate truck door opening detection into your IoT solution. Using ELA Innovations wireless magnetic sensors, you can simply detect when a truck door is open and alert the driver in real time through your business application.",
