    {
      "id": "block-9",
      "order": 8,
      "sectionIndex": 3,
      "elementorId": "bfb920c",
      "widgetType": "text-editor.default",
      "classes": [
        "elementor-element",
        "elementor-element-bfb920c",
        "elementor-widget",
        "elementor-widget-text-editor"
      ],
      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">To implement a solution for&nbsp;detecting the opening of truck doors,&nbsp;you need to equip yourself with magnetic sensors and industrial magnets. The sensor is attached to the inner door of the trailer, and the magnet will be attached to the door pillar in close proximity to the sensor. When the truck doors are opened, the magnetic sensor and the magnet are separated. The information about&nbsp;the sensor’s state change is transmitted via Bluetooth to the IoT platform by the built-in telematics box in the truck’s cab. This box acts as a gateway and sends the information via the mobile network (3G/4G) to the business application. If the truck doors are opened in an “unauthorized” area, a real-time warning is sent to the driver on his smartphone.</span></p>",
      "bodyText": "To implement a solution for detecting the opening of truck doors, you need to equip yourself with magnetic sensors and industrial magnets. The sensor is attached to the inner door of the trailer, and the magnet will be attached to the door pillar in close proximity to the sensor. When the truck doors are opened, the magnetic sensor and the magnet are separated. The information about the sensor’s state change is transmitted via Bluetooth to the IoT platform by the built-in telematics box in the truck’s cab. This box acts as a gateway and sends the information via the mobile network (3G/4G) to the business application. If the truck doors are opened in an “unauthorized” area, a real-time warning is sent to the driver on his smartphone.",
