    {
      "id": "block-11",
      "order": 10,
      "sectionIndex": 4,
      "elementorId": "b05ec00",
      "widgetType": "text-editor.default",
      "classes": [
        "elementor-element",
        "elementor-element-b05ec00",
        "elementor-widget",
        "elementor-widget-text-editor"
      ],
      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">The industrial magnetic sensors from Jaxicloud Fleet Management Innovation are ideal for detecting the opening of truck doors:</span></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">100% independent</span></strong></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Their battery-powered operation provides up to 14 years of autonomy, ensuring competitive total cost of ownership.</span></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Compatible with telematics boxes</span></strong></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Equipped with&nbsp;Bluetooth Low Energy technology,&nbsp;these sensors are compatible with most built-in telematics boxes on the market and require no additional integration.</span></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Quick and easy to install</span></strong></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Easy to install thanks to the different attachment methods (high-performance double-sided sticker or screw-on support), these sensors can&nbsp;be attached to any type of surface&nbsp;and require no wiring.</span></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Industrial boxes</span></strong></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">These sensors are rugged and waterproof and are designed to be used in extreme conditions. They are therefore&nbsp;waterproof and resistant to shock and vibration.</span></p>",
      "bodyText": "The industrial magnetic sensors from Jaxicloud Fleet Management Innovation are ideal for detecting the opening of truck doors:100% independentTheir battery-powered operation provides up to 14 years of autonomy, ensuring competitive total cost of ownership.Compatible with telematics boxesEquipped with Bluetooth Low Energy technology, these sensors are compatible with most built-in telematics boxes on the market and require no additional integration.Quick and easy to installEasy to install thanks to the different attachment methods (high-performance double-sided sticker or screw-on support), these sensors can be attached to any type of surface and require no wiring.Industrial boxesThese sensors are rugged and waterproof and are designed to be used in extreme conditions. They are therefore waterproof and resistant to shock and vibration.",
