      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Bluetooth door sensor </span><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">BLUE COIN MAG is an ultra-compact Bluetooth door sensor. 100% autonomous and robust, this magnetic detection sensor ensures the transport of goods by detecting the opening and closing of truck doors and valves. It is also ideal for smart building applications, measuring space utilization and intrusion into confined spaces. Product sold with Magnet 05 accessory.</span></p>",
